<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n38093" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπανα-λαμβάνω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>take up again, resume, repeat,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πῶς, ὡς . .,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Grg.</u>
				488b
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Lac.</u>
				13.2
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἴπωμεν ἐπαναλαβόντες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Metaph.</u>
					1035b4
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Tht.</u>
				169e
			</span></i>: the part. may be best rendered by an
			Adv., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πολλάκις ἐπαναλαμβάνων
				ἐκέλευέν οἱ λέγειν</span> he ordered him <i>repeatedly,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Phdr.</u>
				228a
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>revise, correct,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				781b
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῇ τροφῇ τὴν κακοπάθειαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Thphr.
					<u>CP</u>
					3.7.8
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>undertake,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				PMasp.
				151.136
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(vi A.D.)</span>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
